      "width": 2200,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "TODAY — not yet in place (intended production still assumes these will be fixed)\n• Replicas default to 0    • Only a development environment    • Namespace override can collapse orgs into one shared namespace\n• GitHub repos are public    • Any valid org login token (JWT) can call org APIs (RBAC not shipped)    • Cloud overlay wiring is not in Cloud GitOps we can see",
